# Product Order Orchestrator configuration: the only place for its secrets.
# Copy to .env (`cp .env.example .env`) and fill in the required values. Every pnpm script loads .env
# (node --env-file-if-exists=.env), including `pnpm start`, so the OpenClaw gateway gets these values from here.
# `pnpm browser:chrome` does not read it. Variables already set in your shell win over this file.
# Optional settings are commented out and show their default.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Anthropic API key used by all four agents (https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Token of YOUR Telegram bot, from @BotFather (/newbot). Keep it secret.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=

# Your numeric Telegram user id: the only account COS talks to.
TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USER_ID=

# Token of the Playwright Extension in Chrome (click its icon; see README). Without it Chrome asks you to approve
# every agent run. Keep it secret: whoever has it can drive this Chrome profile.
PLAYWRIGHT_MCP_EXTENSION_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Browser (Execute and QA fill the basket in your own Chrome profile)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# extension: your Chrome profile through the Playwright Extension (no debugging port).
# cdp: a dedicated Chrome profile with remote debugging (`pnpm browser:chrome`); the basket then lives there.
# BROWSER_MODE=extension
# Extension mode: the Chrome profile folder with the extension (chrome://version → Profile Path ends with it).
# CHROME_PROFILE_DIR=Default
# CDP mode: the endpoint (`pnpm browser:chrome` listens on 9333; CHROME_DEBUG_PORT=<port> in the shell moves it).
# BROWSER_CDP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9333

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Order form (optional: set all four, or none)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Your details for the shop's order form. With all four set, Execute fills the form after the basket and leaves that
# tab open; it never sends the order: check the form there and press "Відправити замовлення" yourself.
# CHECKOUT_NAME=
# International format (spaces, dashes and brackets are fine); the shop's form shows +380 by default.
# CHECKOUT_PHONE=+380XXXXXXXXX
# The delivery option exactly as the shop shows it.
# CHECKOUT_DELIVERY=Доставка Новою поштою
# Delivery address or Nova Poshta branch.
# CHECKOUT_ADDRESS=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shop and runtime files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# DEFAULT_SHOP=karashynyard
# Browser artifacts and local state (relative to the project folder).
# RUNTIME_DIR=.runtime
